WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.643 --> 00:00:17.904
dark-haired girl froze in place, her eyes wide with surprise.

2
00:00:19.025 --> 00:00:21.066
Just then Daisy hurried over with a smile.

3
00:00:21.086 --> 00:00:24.408
"That's not my shirt, Henry," she said.

4
00:00:24.428 --> 00:00:26.509
"That's Kira's.

5
00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:31.192
We went shopping together last week and bought matching show shirts."

6
00:00:32.456 --> 00:00:34.237
Maggie had followed Henry down the aisle.

7
00:00:34.257 --> 00:00:37.599
"Yeah, Kira's nice," she told Henry.

8
00:00:37.619 --> 00:00:40.120
"She and Daisy ride together a lot."

9
00:00:41.321 --> 00:00:42.982
"Oh." Henry felt sheepish.

10
00:00:43.002 --> 00:00:45.643
"Sorry," he told Kira.

11
00:00:46.564 --> 00:00:49.225
"I didn't know that you and Daisy had matching shirts."

12
00:00:50.406 --> 00:00:52.187
"It's okay," Kira said softly.

13
00:00:53.127 --> 00:00:53.888
Daisy grinned.

14
00:00:53.908 --> 00:00:57.990
"We almost didn't have the same shirts," she told Henry.

15
00:00:58.010 --> 00:01:01.112
"Kira didn't have enough cash with her.

16
00:01:01.956 --> 00:01:04.898
So I lent her a few dollars to pay for her shirt."

17
00:01:06.039 --> 00:01:07.800
Kira nodded and looked down at her shirt.

18
00:01:07.820 --> 00:01:11.202
"My parents were pretty mad about that," she admitted.

19
00:01:11.222 --> 00:01:14.964
"They didn't think I should spend so much without asking them first."

20
00:01:14.984 --> 00:01:18.766
"Sounds like my parents," Maggie said with a snort.

21
00:01:18.786 --> 00:01:21.668
"Except they don't even care if I do ask them.

22
00:01:22.288 --> 00:01:23.268
They still say no!"

23
00:01:24.509 --> 00:01:28.992
Henry laughed, but Daisy was starting to look a little upset again as she stared at Kira's shirt.

24
00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:33.202
"Our shirts were expensive," Daisy said.

25
00:01:33.222 --> 00:01:36.965
"I spent three whole weeks' allowance on mine.

26
00:01:36.985 --> 00:01:39.346
And now it's gone!"

27
00:01:39.366 --> 00:01:42.949
"Come on, Daisy," Kira said in her soft voice.

28
00:01:42.969 --> 00:01:45.110
"Let's take the ponies for a walk."

29
00:01:45.130 --> 00:01:51.374
"Okay." Daisy led Coco out of her stall again.

30
00:01:55.117 --> 00:01:59.440
After Daisy and Kira left, Henry followed Maggie back toward Big Spot's stall.

31
00:02:00.444 --> 00:02:03.446
He looked around to make sure nobody else was close enough to hear him.

32
00:02:03.466 --> 00:02:06.688
"We have our first suspect," he said.

33
00:02:07.709 --> 00:02:10.610
Then he told Maggie about what Rebecca had said about Coco.

34
00:02:11.651 --> 00:02:13.252
When he finished, Maggie nodded.

35
00:02:13.272 --> 00:02:16.754
"Rebecca is pretty spoiled," she said.

36
00:02:16.774 --> 00:02:19.575
"She's always whining about something.

37
00:02:20.276 --> 00:02:21.957
She's definitely a good suspect."

38
00:02:21.977 --> 00:02:25.359
"Now we need to look for proof she did it."

39
00:02:25.679 --> 00:02:27.160
Henry glanced around the barn again.

40
00:02:28.392 --> 00:02:32.654
"Are you sure Cole didn't come in here to look for clues by Coco's stall?"

41
00:02:33.714 --> 00:02:35.475
"I'm positive," Maggie said.

42
00:02:35.495 --> 00:02:37.596
"I definitely would have seen him."

43
00:02:37.616 --> 00:02:39.857
"So where did he go?"

44
00:02:40.137 --> 00:02:40.837
Henry mumbled.

45
00:02:41.978 --> 00:02:42.778
Maggie giggled.

46
00:02:44.339 --> 00:02:47.000
"Maybe Cole should be a suspect too," she joked.

47
00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:51.962
"His motive could be that he wants to wear Daisy's show shirt to his next swim meet."

48
00:02:53.342 --> 00:02:54.303
"Very funny."

49
00:02:54.623 --> 00:02:55.343
Henry grinned.

50
00:02:55.363 --> 00:02:59.770
"Anyway, I guess the mystery of the missing friend can wait.

51
00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:03.692
If Cole hasn't looked for clues yet, I'd better do it."

52
00:03:04.732 --> 00:03:06.233
"I'll help you," Maggie said.

53
00:03:06.253 --> 00:03:08.654
"Big Spot is almost ready for the show.

54
00:03:09.615 --> 00:03:12.477
All I have to do is put his bridle on when it's time for our class."

55
00:03:13.577 --> 00:03:16.119
Henry and Maggie walked over to Coco's empty stall.

56
00:03:16.139 --> 00:03:22.102
"Look." Henry pointed to an empty clothes hanger hanging on the stall door next to a coat.

57
00:03:22.122 --> 00:03:25.584
"This must be where Daisy's shirt was hanging."

58
00:03:26.644 --> 00:03:28.145
"Yeah," Maggie agreed.

59
00:03:28.165 --> 00:03:31.386
"It's weird that Daisy's show coat is still here."

60
00:03:31.646 --> 00:03:32.767
She touched the wool coat.

61
00:03:32.787 --> 00:03:36.208
"A show coat costs a lot more than a show shirt.

62
00:03:37.129 --> 00:03:38.889
Why wouldn't someone steal that instead?"

63
00:03:38.909 --> 00:03:40.710
"I don't know."

64
00:03:41.190 --> 00:03:42.711
Henry saw a boy walking by.

65
00:03:42.731 --> 00:03:45.632
"Excuse me," he said to him.

66
00:03:45.652 --> 00:03:49.334
"Did you notice anyone near this stall earlier?"

67
00:03:50.414 --> 00:03:51.395
The boy blinked at him.

68
00:03:51.415 --> 00:03:53.556
"No," he said.

69
00:03:54.328 --> 00:03:56.489
"I just got back from giving my horse a bath."

70
00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:01.631
The next rider Henry asked, a teenager named Jill, shook her head.

71
00:04:01.651 --> 00:04:04.712
"I didn't notice anyone," she said.

72
00:04:04.732 --> 00:04:08.334
"Why? Are you guys investigating another mystery?"

73
00:04:08.354 --> 00:04:10.655
"Yes," Henry admitted.

74
00:04:10.675 --> 00:04:13.036
"Daisy's show shirt is missing."

75
00:04:13.056 --> 00:04:15.517
"Oh, is that all?"

76
00:04:15.757 --> 00:04:17.617
Jill glanced over at Big Spot and grinned.

77
00:04:17.637 --> 00:04:19.718
"Big Spot probably ate it.

78
00:04:20.439 --> 00:04:22.019
That pony is always hungry!"

79
00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:23.520
She hurried away.

80
00:04:24.688 --> 00:04:26.649
"Do ponies really eat shirts?"

81
00:04:27.049 --> 00:04:28.009
Henry asked Maggie.

82
00:04:28.029 --> 00:04:31.130
"Big Spot tries to eat everything, remember?

83
00:04:33.551 --> 00:04:35.531
Or at least he likes to grab things and taste them."

84
00:04:36.591 --> 00:04:38.592
Maggie hurried back to Big Spot's stall.

85
00:04:39.692 --> 00:04:41.293
She stepped inside and looked around.

86
00:04:41.313 --> 00:04:43.893
"I don't see the shirt in here, though."

87
00:04:45.054 --> 00:04:48.835
Henry glanced from Big Spot's stall to the spot where Daisy's things were hanging.

88
00:04:48.855 --> 00:04:53.056
"There's no way Big Spot could reach the shirt from here.

89
00:04:54.084 --> 00:04:56.026
I don't think your pony is our culprit."

90
00:04:57.007 --> 00:04:59.489
Henry questioned a few more riders who passed by.

91
00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:02.852
But none of them seemed to know anything about the crime.

92
00:05:04.213 --> 00:05:06.595
Everyone was distracted by the show preparations.

93
00:05:07.956 --> 00:05:08.437
Then Ms.

94
00:05:08.537 --> 00:05:09.798
Wood stepped into the barn.

95
00:05:09.818 --> 00:05:13.741
"Riders in the beginners class, please bring your ponies out!"

96
00:05:14.122 --> 00:05:15.483
she called in a loud voice.

97
00:05:15.503 --> 00:05:18.585
"It's time to start warming up in the ring."

98
00:05:18.605 --> 00:05:20.347
"Warming up?"

99
00:05:20.647 --> 00:05:21.288
Henry said.

100
00:05:22.148 --> 00:05:24.649
"I thought everybody would be warm enough already."

101
00:05:24.669 --> 00:05:26.609
"Very funny."

102
00:05:27.270 --> 00:05:28.750
Maggie grabbed Big Spot's bridle.

103
00:05:28.770 --> 00:05:31.671
"Hold still, Big Spot," she said.

104
00:05:31.691 --> 00:05:33.952
"I just need to Ugh!"

105
00:05:34.512 --> 00:05:35.612
She jumped back quickly.

106
00:05:35.632 --> 00:05:37.173
"What happened?"

107
00:05:37.393 --> 00:05:38.073
Henry asked.

108
00:05:38.093 --> 00:05:40.233
"Did Big Spot bite you?"

109
00:05:40.253 --> 00:05:43.334
"No! He slimed me!"

110
00:05:44.215 --> 00:05:48.536
Maggie turned around, revealing a huge, bright blue stain on the front of her white shirt.
